      "comment": "ONYX JAX (8) turned in a plain performance last time when sixth at Q Lakeside over 457m behind In The Jungle (26.10) in a Grade 6. Form from his last run is proving strong. Can bounce back. HIGH LEAK (2) is rarely far away but tends to find one better, placing 12 from 21 starts. Finished in the minors latest when third (30.91) at this track and may be close to breaking through. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Can measure up. CANDY DASH (1) jumps from the inside draw. Last start finished 4th on November 14 over 520m at this track behind Canya Let Loose beaten 12 lengths (30.93) in a Grade 6. Can hit the frame with the right run. CLARET AND BLUE (7) has been in the frame at her last two runs, most recently when second (30.78) in a Grade 6 over 520m at this track. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from on outside draw.",
